                                                "sense_id": "14da526a-706b-3907-aa9c-f28ed2f74861",
                                                "text": "A 12-acre field of good, deep land on the farm of Frenchlaw, in Berwickshire, was rendered swampy by springs and oozings of water from the surrounding rising ground being retained upon the clay subsoil."
